{"id": "EUVD-2026-69796", "enisaUuid": "ebcfb979-9587-3f3b-ab83-d1e9780554d2", "description": "ION-DTN versions before 4.2.0 contain an out-of-bounds read vulnerability in the decodeSdnv function that allows unauthenticated remote attackers to read memory by sending truncated SDNV values. Attackers can send a UDP datagram to the LTP link service input port with a truncated SDNV to trigger reads up to nine bytes past buffer boundaries and underflow byte counters.", "datePublished": "2026-09-02T01:18:14", "dateUpdated": "2026-09-24T14:20:37", "baseScore": 8.7, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:N/VC:N/VI:N/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/nasa-jpl/ION-DTN/security/advisories/GHSA-85pw-28vw-2jf7", "https://github.com/nasa-jpl/ION-DTN/commit/d52d22bdd383798712357f86a2778757f740e812", "https://github.com/nasa-jpl/ION-DTN/releases/tag/ion-open-source-4.2.0", "https://github.com/nasa-jpl/ION-DTN/blob/ion-open-source-4.1.4/ici/library/platform.c#L1982", "https://github.com/nasa-jpl/ION-DTN/blob/ion-open-source-4.1.4/ici/library/ion.c#L1693", "https://github.com/nasa-jpl/ION-DTN", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/ion-dtn-before-4.2.0-out-of-bounds-read-via-decodesdnv"], "aliases": ["GHSA-5vmj-4h65-2fh8", "CVE-2026-84484"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.87, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "6698aba4-4637-3f92-9d27-644b3c749d2b", "product": {"name": "ION-DTN", "vendor": {"name": "nasa-jpl"}}, "product_version": "0 <4.2.0"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "09dcf54f-7a01-3db0-b9f5-97963696b088", "vendor": {"name": "nasa-jpl"}}], "isExploited": false}